*~

# ---- OS ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---- Logs ----
*.log
logs/

# ---- Spike run outputs ----
# Per-spike run artifacts (figures, audits, iter sources, audit-view staging) are
# ephemeral — they're produced fresh by every spike and bloat the repo. The
# canonical prompts live in resources/prompts/; the prompt-iteration history
# stays under spike-results/prompts/ (tracked, small).
spike-results/claude-code-*/
spike-results/codex-*/

# Stray spike outputs that occasionally land at the repo root when an iter
# script chdir's wrong:
/img_iter*.png
/figure_iter*.py
/figure_iter*.pdf
/floor_selfcheck_iter*.txt
/audit_iter*.json
/audit_iter*.stderr
/notes_iter*.md

# ---- Misc tool markers ----
# Ignore Codex runtime state but track project-level skill and context files.
.codex/cache
.codex/sessions
.codex/ambient-suggestions
.codex/archived_sessions
.codex/logs_2.sqlite*
.codex/state_5.sqlite*
.codex/session_index.jsonl
.codex/models_cache.json
.codex/installation_id
.codex/auth.json
.codex/tmp
.codex/vendor_imports
.codex/memories
.codex/sqlite
.codex/shell_snapshots

# ---- FigMirror skill workspace ----
# Per-run output directories (each run produces ~10-30 MB of iter
